" height="1536" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/sybrand/6a6bb1dea4bb8.jpg" width="2048"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://sybrand.some.pics"&gt;@sybrand&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 20:22:03 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a6b8a78af8e7</link><description>&lt;p&gt;今天的太阳。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A bunch of small yellow blossoms in the shade." height="2000" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/z428/6a6b8a78af8e7.jpg" width="1122"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://z428.some.pics"&gt;@z428&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 17:31:39 +0000</pubDate></item><item><title/><link>https://some.pics/6a6b829649fe9</link><description>&lt;p&gt;昨天看完《奥德赛》后，我受到启发画了一个独眼巨人。我参考了雷·哈里豪森在《辛巴达第七次航行》中设计的独眼巨人形象。&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;img alt="A hand-drawn sketch of a cartoonish cyclops with greenish, textured skin, a single large eye, pointed ears, a horn on its head, and sharp teeth. The creature is shown from the chest up against a warm tan background, with its mouth open in a playful, snarling expression." height="1730" referrerpolicy="no-referrer" src="https://cdn.some.pics/dhester/6a6b829649fe9.jpg" width="1730"/&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;Shared by &lt;a href="https://dhester.some.pics"&gt;@dhester&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description><pubDate>Thu, 30 Jul 2026 16:58:01 +0000</pubDate></item></channel></rss>